  "_note": "MOS 6532 RIOT (RAM-I/O-Timer). Pin table from MOS Technology 6532 datasheet. DIP-40 package. 128 bytes static RAM, two 8-bit I/O ports (PA0-PA7, PB0-PB7), programmable interval timer. 7-bit address bus (A0-A6), 8-bit data bus (D0-D7). RS (pin 32, RAM/IO select), CS1 (pin 34, chip select 1 active high), CS2B (pin 35, chip select 2 active low), RSB (pin 31, reset active low), IRQB (pin 22, interrupt request active low), RW (pin 33, read/write), PHI2 (pin 40, clock). VSS=pin 1 (GND), VCC=pin 21.",
